author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 480
acceptance_criteria: "A fixture with two branches that each import the same external issue, one adding comments and status changes and the other a sync import, merges without conflict markers; the merged item carries both sides' comments, pm history --verify passes and a repeat import is a no-op; Add/add with different external identities or without importer provenance still refuses with today's message; The SDK exposes the identity rule so importer extensions declare their identity fields, and pm merge reconcile --dry-run names the rule it applied"
parent: pm-dj98
